---
// Illustration of an Estate Map: what you own, the plan, and the people you choose.
// Generic and fictional; no client data.
---
<figure class="emap" aria-label="Illustration of an Estate Map: what you own on one side, the people you choose on the other, and your plan in the middle">
  <div class="emap__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Estate Map</span></div>
  <div class="emap__grid">
    <div class="emap__col">
      <p class="emap__k">What you own</p>
      <div class="chip">Home in Austin<small>Passes by deed or trust</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Bank &amp; brokerage<small>Passes by trust or account form</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Retirement accounts<small>Passes by beneficiary form</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Life insurance<small>Passes by beneficiary form</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Business interest<small>Company agreement + plan</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="emap__hub" aria-hidden="false">
      <div class="hub"><span class="hub__k">Your plan</span><b>Trust · Wills · Powers of attorney · Directive</b></div>
    </div>
    <div class="emap__col">
      <p class="emap__k">Who you choose</p>
      <div class="chip">Acts for you if you can't<small>Agent under power of attorney</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Makes medical decisions<small>Medical agent</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Settles the estate<small>Executor · successor trustee</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Cares for minor children<small>Guardian</small></div>
      <div class="chip">Inherits<small>Family · charity</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Illustration. Your own map is built live with Russ during the session.</figcaption>
</figure>
